Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:01.60,0:00:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人世謂緣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:05.10,0:00:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繫結的絲線糾結纏繞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:07.40,0:00:09.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脆弱可悲的彼岸花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:10.00,0:00:13.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在憤怒 悲傷 淚水中度日
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:14.50,0:00:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午夜零點的帷幕彼方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:17.20,0:00:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難消之恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:23.80,0:00:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}いつか{\K80}光{\K40}に向{\K40}か{\K60}う　{\K60\K30}逆{\K90}さまの{\K60}蝶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:29.00,0:00:33.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}君{\K20}と{\K40}髪{\K50}を{\K30}切{\K60}る　{\K30\K80}鏡{\K40}の{\K100}中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:34.20,0:00:39.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}授業{\K50}中{\K60}の{\K80}廊下　{\K80\K40}響{\K40}く{\K100}足音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:39.90,0:00:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn华文细黑\K20}絶{\K20}えず{\K30}雨{\K40}の{\K60}音{\K60}が　{\K20\K40}つい{\K50}て{\K40\K40}くる{\K50}よ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:45.30,0:00:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}感{\K30}じ{\K45}る{\K45}まま{\K30}の{\K70\K60}形{\K40}は{\K60}眩{\K60}しい
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:50.50,0:00:55.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}甘{\K30}い{\K50}花{\K50}にな{\K80}る　{\K20\K30}毒{\K10}の{\K10}実{\K10}に{\K60}も{\K60}なる
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:55.80,0:01:00.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}今日{\K60}も{\K120}雨　{\K40\K40}あの{\K120}日と今{\K40}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:01.00,0:01:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn华文细黑\K30}空{\K30}と{\K30}空{\K30}で{\K30}つ{\K60}なぎ{\K80}た{\K30}い{\K60}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:05.30,0:01:08.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:08.30,0:01:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:11.10,0:01:15.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:16.20,0:01:18.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:18.70,0:01:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K160}ひとつの{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:21.60,0:01:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:27.20,0:01:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K20}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:29.60,0:01:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:32.40,0:01:37.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.90,0:01:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K10}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:40.40,0:01:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K140}それぞれの{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:43.20,0:01:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:57.70,0:02:00.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那時還以爲她已經不行了呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:00.30,0:02:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紅老師能重新振作起來真是太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:04.20,0:02:07.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因爲出現了後繼者又提起勁頭了呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:07.30,0:02:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 是呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:09.60,0:02:12.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紅老師 好久沒見了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:12.70,0:02:15.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好 哎呀 這位是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:15.30,0:02:17.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,初次見面 紅老師
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:17.50,0:02:19.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,確實是在電視上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:19.60,0:02:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 是我們公司的藝人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:21.60,0:02:23.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫來島薰子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:23.50,0:02:25.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是紅 請多關照啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:25.70,0:02:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是老師的忠實影迷啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:28.40,0:02:31.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然能再觀賞到老師的戲劇女流偵探
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:31.70,0:02:33.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我現在好期待呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:33.60,0:02:34.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:34.70,0:02:36.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請加油 我先走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:37.10,0:02:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼老師 待會兒見
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:39.30,0:02:42.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs20}太棒了 一直那麼成熟…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:41.20,0:02:42.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是個可愛的人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:42.90,0:02:44.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起這個 彩花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:44.20,0:02:46.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被別人說“現在好期待”呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:46.70,0:02:48.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不能把戲演砸了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:49.10,0:02:50.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:58.50,0:02:59.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在幹什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:59.70,0:03:03.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行啊 你是大街上的垂柳啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:03.60,0:03:05.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼晃晃悠悠的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:05.70,0:03:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又沒有颳風
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:07.70,0:03:09.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 非常抱歉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:09.60,0:03:11.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 再來一次
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:11.60,0:03:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:14.70,0:03:16.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是棵柳樹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:16.50,0:03:19.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靜靜佇立在河邊的柳樹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:21.00,0:03:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 你要我說幾次啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:23.90,0:03:25.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常抱歉 非常抱歉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:25.70,0:03:28.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不像是爲了培養未來的招牌女演員
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:28.20,0:03:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倒像是爲了虐待她而收養的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:31.10,0:03:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 沒有那回事啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:33.20,0:03:35.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過 人家會這個說也沒辦法
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:36.40,0:03:38.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彩花真是可憐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:47.90,0:03:50.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託了 拜託了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:59.30,0:04:04.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}龜裂的面具
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:23.80,0:04:24.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,誰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:25.50,0:04:26.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你呼喚我的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:28.00,0:04:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是閻魔愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:33.00,0:04:35.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄 少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:37.50,0:04:38.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請收下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:40.90,0:04:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你若真的要消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:45.70,0:04:47.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將那紅線解開即可
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:49.30,0:04:50.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解開繩線
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:50.80,0:04:54.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就和我正式締結了契約
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:54.50,0:04:58.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怨恨的人將立刻墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:00.40,0:05:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:04.40,0:05:05.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨若已消除
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:06.20,0:05:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自身亦將付出代價
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:10.20,0:05:11.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,代價
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:11.90,0:05:14.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害人終害己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:15.20,0:05:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你死後
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:17.00,0:05:19.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靈魂亦將墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:20.20,0:05:21.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:31.30,0:05:32.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還是算了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:32.50,0:05:33.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:34.30,0:05:36.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讓我再考慮下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:37.40,0:05:38.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:57.40,0:05:59.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收我爲養女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:59.60,0:06:01.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那時我的演技應該是被認可了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:03.00,0:06:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但這羞辱又算什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:05.30,0:06:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已經受不了了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:06.90,0:06:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下地獄去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:08.30,0:06:10.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呦 彩花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:10.20,0:06:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,武
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:11.30,0:06:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都這年紀了還在玩人偶啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:14.00,0:06:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 樣子還真是奇怪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:17.30,0:06:18.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要詛咒殺了誰嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:19.00,0:06:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真羅嗦 不用你管
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:22.50,0:06:23.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:23.80,0:06:25.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手 還給我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:26.20,0:06:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做得不錯啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:27.90,0:06:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,給我適可而止啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:29.30,0:06:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:31.40,0:06:32.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好險
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:33.60,0:06:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,話說回來 彩花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:35.20,0:06:37.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能借我點錢嗎 十萬左右
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:37.90,0:06:39.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼要那麼多錢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:39.50,0:06:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,當我那麼好騙啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:41.60,0:06:43.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你被戶好人家收養了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:43.90,0:06:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這點錢不算什麼 對吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:46.50,0:06:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這兩個累贅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:48.30,0:06:52.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對了 靠地獄通信或許還不如找這兩個白癡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:53.70,0:06:56.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是不可以借給你們 有個條件
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:56.80,0:06:59.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不愧是彩花 通情達理
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:59.40,0:07:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你說什麼我都會聽的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:13.40,0:07:14.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚上好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:15.10,0:07:16.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打擾了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:16.60,0:07:18.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們要幹什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:18.80,0:07:20.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我說阿姨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:20.20,0:07:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,施捨點錢吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:21.60,0:07:23.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們肚子餓扁了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:23.50,0:07:26.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快出去 不然我要大叫了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:27.60,0:07:31.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,試試看啊 在這之前先打爛你的臉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:33.60,0:07:36.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋 膽子可不小
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:36.40,0:07:38.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,給我老實點
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:39.20,0:07:41.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快點把錢給我拿出來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:42.30,0:07:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彩花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:43.20,0:07:44.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:44.90,0:07:48.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你 你 你幹什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:48.80,0:07:51.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,閉嘴 再不出去我要報警了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:53.00,0:07:56.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混帳 給我記着 我會找你算帳的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:02.40,0:08:03.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厲害的女人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:03.70,0:08:07.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在的那些男青年還真沒骨氣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:07.70,0:08:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您沒有受傷吧 媽媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:10.10,0:08:11.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 沒事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:11.80,0:08:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:13.20,0:08:14.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以防萬一還是報警吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:14.50,0:08:15.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彩花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:15.80,0:08:19.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剛纔那兩個人難道是你以前的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:19.50,0:08:21.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 媽媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:21.80,0:08:24.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,實際上幾天前他們就糾纏着我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:25.10,0:08:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還威脅要把以前的一些事向媒體暴光
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:30.30,0:08:32.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 既然出了這種事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:32.70,0:08:35.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天我就到警署去報警抓他們
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:36.50,0:08:38.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能夠相信你嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:38.40,0:08:40.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,當然了 媽媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:40.90,0:08:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,話說 這麼晚了你上哪幹什麼去了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:45.20,0:08:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在排練場做柳樹的練習
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:47.50,0:08:49.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能夠演好了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:49.50,0:08:50.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 還沒有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:51.10,0:08:55.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過我會努力的  決不會給著名女演員紅翠的後繼者這個名分抹黑
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:56.00,0:08:56.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:57.20,0:08:59.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已經很晚了 去睡吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:59.40,0:09:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 晚安
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:09.60,0:09:12.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這事得通知小姐啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:12.70,0:09:14.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐會怎麼做呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:14.50,0:09:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,誰知道呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:24.70,0:09:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次公演的女流偵探
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:27.00,0:09:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說的是推理作家身邊出現了一名自稱是她崇拜者的年輕女子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:30.90,0:09:33.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,展開一場死亡遊戲的對手戲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:34.40,0:09:36.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是團長的出道作品
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:36.50,0:09:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前團長演過的年輕女孩角色還沒決定好由誰扮演
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:41.80,0:09:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過肯定會選彩花的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:44.80,0:09:47.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彩花演戲演得很好吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:48.10,0:09:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,當然 是看中了彩花的演技才收她爲養女的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:53.30,0:09:57.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,團長也將這次公演作爲最後演出然後引退
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:57.20,0:09:59.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像以後的都打算交給彩花吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:00.00,0:10:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,團長由彩花接替 大家都贊成嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:05.10,0:10:08.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪的問題呢 當然贊成啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:08.50,0:10:11.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彩花既認真 又不擺架子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:12.00,0:10:14.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,團長的通知 所有人到練習室集合
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:14.80,0:10:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:23.80,0:10:25.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人都到齊了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:25.40,0:10:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼現在公佈下次公演中與我演對手戲的人員
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:29.90,0:10:31.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這一天終於來到了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:32.20,0:10:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忍耐到今天也算值得了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:34.90,0:10:36.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請進來吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:42.00,0:10:43.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來島燻子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:43.90,0:10:47.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也曾演過電視劇 大家想必也認識吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:47.80,0:10:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的對手將由她來扮演
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:50.80,0:10:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是來島 請多多關照
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:53.40,0:10:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎 爲什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:55.20,0:10:56.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是彩花啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:56.60,0:10:58.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒想到突然找了外面的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:59.10,0:11:01.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎…怎麼回事 這是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:02.10,0:11:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常榮幸 紅老師
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:04.30,0:11:07.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒想到能夠出演女流偵探
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:06.00,0:11:07.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個女人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:07.90,0:11:08.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像是做夢一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:09.10,0:11:11.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很期待你的表現 加油哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:11.80,0:11:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:14.00,0:11:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個臭女人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:18.80,0:11:21.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽 這是怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:21.90,0:11:24.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我能力不夠嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:24.60,0:11:26.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 你還不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:26.70,0:11:28.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我無法接受
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:28.20,0:11:30.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是哪裏不足 請跟我說明
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:31.60,0:11:32.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你聽好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:33.00,0:11:36.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,表情和聲音就是演戲的話你就大錯特錯了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:36.80,0:11:41.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有一根手指的動作沒有用心體會 那就不是演戲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:42.00,0:11:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 那是什麼意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:43.80,0:11:46.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要裝傻了 就是昨晚的那事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:47.00,0:11:48.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:48.80,0:11:50.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是無可救藥的人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:50.30,0:11:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以說這麼拙劣的戲就別演了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:53.30,0:11:54.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老師
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:54.60,0:11:55.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就這樣了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:56.00,0:11:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在因爲公演的事我已經很忙了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:59.40,0:12:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,會分心的 所以請出去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:04.60,0:12:07.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不甘心的話 就把演技磨練得更好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:14.60,0:12:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暴露了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:15.90,0:12:19.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不會 我的演技應該是完美的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:20.30,0:12:23.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對了 那兩個傢伙走漏風聲了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:30.80,0:12:32.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼 真菜
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:33.40,0:12:35.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼嘛 那爛透了的演技
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:35.70,0:12:38.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就那種本事也想取代我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:39.00,0:12:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臉簡直比犀牛皮還厚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:41.20,0:12:42.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早點自己退出吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:43.60,0:12:46.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對了 只要讓她退出就行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:55.00,0:12:58.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 我們可沒走漏風聲啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:58.20,0:13:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 就當是這麼回事吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:00.70,0:13:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,錢的事呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:02.20,0:13:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對對 就是爲這事打電話給你的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:04.40,0:13:06.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個 如果加倍付錢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:06.40,0:13:08.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能不能再拜託你件事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:14.30,0:13:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來島 怎麼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:17.90,0:13:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是誰 到底是誰做出這麼過分的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:21.40,0:13:23.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 彩花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:23.50,0:13:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是爲了我的話 請不要做這種事了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:28.10,0:13:31.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我根本沒有介意 是真的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:37.80,0:13:39.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剛纔的事謝謝你啊 彩花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:40.10,0:13:43.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其實 接下這角色很開心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:43.40,0:13:45.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但也一直覺得很對不起彩花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:47.00,0:13:48.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒關係 不用放在心上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:49.00,0:13:51.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果這樣一開始拒絕不就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:54.90,0:13:56.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是要幹什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:56.30,0:13:58.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是在策劃什麼陰謀啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:03.00,0:14:04.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:04.20,0:14:05.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼樣 開心嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:05.90,0:14:08.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 那個 不好意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:09.00,0:14:10.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已經很晚了 我…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:10.70,0:14:14.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還早嘛 好不容易我們成了朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:14.50,0:14:15.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:16.60,0:14:18.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呦 可愛的小姑娘
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:19.10,0:14:20.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什麼事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:20.30,0:14:20.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是這女孩麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:21.00,0:14:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:22.70,0:14:24.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超靚啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:24.30,0:14:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 之後就拜託你們了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:25.60,0:14:26.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,OK
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:26.80,0:14:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彩…彩花 等下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:28.90,0:14:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來吧 你來這邊吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:35.40,0:14:36.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讓…讓我回去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:37.10,0:14:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 不讓你回去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:39.60,0:14:41.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託了 積點德吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:41.70,0:14:44.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天還有重要的練習
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:44.50,0:14:46.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個 喝了就讓你走
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:46.80,0:14:48.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:48.30,0:14:50.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讓聲音變得動聽無比的藥
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:50.30,0:14:51.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:52.40,0:14:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓緊了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:55.30,0:14:58.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來吧 一口氣喝掉就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:19.60,0:15:20.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聽說了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:20.80,0:15:23.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,燻子好像發不出聲音了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:23.70,0:15:25.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼回事啊 是不是壓力太大
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:26.30,0:15:27.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:28.50,0:15:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底發生了什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:30.80,0:15:32.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是那麼地努力
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:34.00,0:15:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼哼 要恨的話就恨這個女人吧 燻子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:42.40,0:15:43.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:44.40,0:15:46.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讓團員在排練場集合
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:46.70,0:15:48.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有重要通知
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:48.70,0:15:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:50.00,0:15:52.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要將主角換作我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:53.30,0:15:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:55.30,0:15:58.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道我要通知什麼嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:58.30,0:15:58.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:59.80,0:16:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次公演終止 劇團也一併解散
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:03.10,0:16:06.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且斷絕與你的養母女關係
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:09.20,0:16:10.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你乾的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:11.30,0:16:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什 什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:13.30,0:16:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以叫你不要再演這麼拙劣的戲了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:16.50,0:16:19.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別再糊塗了 你可騙不了我的眼睛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:19.90,0:16:24.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是誤會 之前那晚的事情真的不關我的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:24.40,0:16:28.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被媽媽收養的時候 我就像是重生了一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:28.30,0:16:30.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能夠跟媽媽您相遇真的是太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:31.10,0:16:34.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多虧了媽媽我才能瞭解到演戲的樂趣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:34.50,0:16:36.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,並找到了活下去的希望
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:36.70,0:16:39.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是多麼感謝媽媽啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:41.20,0:16:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:42.60,0:16:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是不像樣 快放手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:44.70,0:16:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎樣 我已經決定了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:46.90,0:16:48.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這件事也已經告訴顧問律師了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:50.40,0:16:51.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今後就永別了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:54.60,0:16:57.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼 你這臭老太婆
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:00.30,0:17:03.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傷心啊 說什麼臭老太婆
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:04.10,0:17:06.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請不要說那麼讓人傷心的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:07.90,0:17:09.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至今所做的一切都是爲了你啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:10.30,0:17:12.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然教導或許過於嚴格
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:13.80,0:17:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你的所作所爲無法讓人原諒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:17.30,0:17:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過如果你能夠承認自己所犯的錯誤併爲此改過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:21.80,0:17:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到那時如果你還想繼續演戲的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:25.90,0:17:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我會把你介紹給朋友的劇團
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:30.90,0:17:34.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒關係的 還可以從頭再來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:34.70,0:17:38.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以你的才能肯定能成爲一個出色的演員
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:39.00,0:17:40.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,開什麼玩笑
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:40.50,0:17:41.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你說什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:41.80,0:17:42.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是煩人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:43.20,0:17:44.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘮叨已經夠多的了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:45.20,0:17:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那算什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:46.80,0:17:51.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能繼承你的名號誰會來陪你玩什麼過家家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:51.60,0:17:54.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,無法得到你的財產和名聲的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:55.00,0:17:56.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這就根本沒有意義 不明白嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:58.00,0:17:59.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惜啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:59.70,0:18:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情成了現在這樣 真是很可惜
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:04.00,0:18:05.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說可惜就完了嗎 混蛋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:07.00,0:18:08.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:08.80,0:18:11.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣的話 我也不管那麼多了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:13.00,0:18:14.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然走到了這步
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:14.80,0:18:17.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在養母女關係解除前她死掉的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:17.70,0:18:20.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少財產可以歸我所有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:21.30,0:18:22.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下地獄去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:25.00,0:18:26.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲…爲什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:26.80,0:18:27.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不明白嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:28.30,0:18:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什麼時候
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:29.80,0:18:32.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 這是怎麼了 爲什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:32.60,0:18:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因爲有人先解開了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:35.10,0:18:35.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:36.20,0:18:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個人昨晚登錄了地獄通信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:41.90,0:18:44.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在剛纔解開了紅線
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:45.30,0:18:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你說什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:48.90,0:18:51.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:02.00,0:19:05.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已經晚了一步 請放棄吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:05.40,0:19:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:06.50,0:19:07.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我在先的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:08.00,0:19:10.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎麼回事 回答我啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:10.50,0:19:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 慢着 等等啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:16.80,0:19:19.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是什麼舞臺
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:23.00,0:19:26.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你準備認罪了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:26.40,0:19:27.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是誰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:27.30,0:19:31.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不認罪的話就會墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:31.30,0:19:32.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這也沒關係嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:33.00,0:19:34.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那…那麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:34.60,0:19:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要去地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:35.70,0:19:37.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我認罪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:38.20,0:19:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:39.20,0:19:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纔怪呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:43.80,0:19:45.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剛纔是誰的聲音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:45.40,0:19:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:49.70,0:19:51.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂喂 劇演錯了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:51.90,0:19:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臺詞不是口頭上 而是要發自內心啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:55.90,0:19:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 我覺得燻子她真是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:58.40,0:20:00.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活該啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:01.00,0:20:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在搞什麼鬼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:03.70,0:20:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎 你這戲真糟糕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:07.00,0:20:08.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太低級趣味了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:08.50,0:20:10.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是 不是我的錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:14.20,0:20:17.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什…什麼 發生了什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:20.20,0:20:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:21.90,0:20:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手 好痛 好痛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:25.50,0:20:28.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:35.80,0:20:38.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停下 戲已經演夠了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:39.10,0:20:43.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要聽的不是你的臺詞 而是你真心話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:46.80,0:20:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請相信我 這就是真實的我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:50.90,0:20:54.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不對不對 不是這樣的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:56.50,0:20:57.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,開始吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:58.80,0:21:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:00.60,0:21:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼想聽我就說給你們聽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:03.00,0:21:05.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,演戲根本就無所謂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:05.60,0:21:07.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對我來說不過是個臺階
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:08.30,0:21:09.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲了成功
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:10.10,0:21:13.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對啊 好不容易學到的演技
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:14.10,0:21:16.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在該騙人的時候就要騙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:16.90,0:21:19.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有時是誰都尊敬的著名女演員
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:20.00,0:21:22.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有時又是高貴的夫人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:23.10,0:21:25.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而有的時候又是充滿醜聞的魔性之女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:26.10,0:21:27.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有時又是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:27.20,0:21:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 到底哪個是真實的你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:33.10,0:21:36.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迷失於黑暗中的可悲之影
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:36.60,0:21:39.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傷害鄙視他人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:39.60,0:21:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沉溺於罪惡的孽魂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:44.90,0:21:47.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來死一次吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:01.00,0:22:03.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是哪裏啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:04.90,0:22:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很逼真的演技啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:07.60,0:22:10.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你至今爲止最出色的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:14.40,0:22:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此怨此恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:17.70,0:22:19.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將流向地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:30.90,0:22:32.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 借過一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:33.20,0:22:34.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 拿一下扳手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:34.90,0:22:35.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:56.90,0:23:01.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,君之怨恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:15.70,0:23:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}い{\K30}つ{\K30}だっ{\K200}て　{\K30}行{\K30}き{\K30}止{\K30}まり{\K200}で
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:22.20,0:23:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}決{\K20}し{\K100}て　{\K40}逃{\K45}げ{\K40}ら{\K40}れ{\K70}な{\K200}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:29.10,0:23:42.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}空{\K140}の{\K40}鳥{\K120}へ　{\K40}哀{\K40}し{\K80}み{\K80}の{\K200}せ　{\K100}飛{\K40}ば{\K80}す{\K200}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:46.20,0:23:49.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K50}ここ{\K140}は{\K20}仮{\K70}縫{\K70}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:50.00,0:24:00.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K210}私{\K180}を{\K60\K100}縛{\K60}る{\K30\K140}永{\K200}遠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:01.00,0:24:07.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K80}行{\K20}き{\K100}も{\K30\K100}帰{\K80}り{\K200}も
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:08.00,0:24:20.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}過{\K30}ぎ{\K40}て{\K40\K240}ゆ{\K220}く{\K220}は{\K100}夢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:30.45,0:24:32.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本故事純屬虛構\N登場人物名 團體名等全部與現實無關
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:33.60,0:24:35.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,名字是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:35.40,0:24:36.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,田沼千恵
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:37.10,0:24:39.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨他嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:39.60,0:24:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因爲他的錯 祐子她
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:43.10,0:24:44.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是愛他的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:44.90,0:24:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的愛着他
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:48.30,0:24:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,願望是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:50.40,0:24:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將他流放到地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:53.80,0:24:56.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:58.00,0:25:02.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an7\c&H0000FF&}下集
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:58.00,0:25:02.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}寂靜的交往
